  "level": "A1",
  "topic": "some / any with countable & uncountable nouns",
  "category": "Grammar",
  "contentType": "grammar",
  "status": "ready",
  "description": "Talk about food, supplies, and quantities naturally: We’ve got some rice , There isn’t any milk , and Is there any coffee?",
